### Create a recovery
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
{
  "scheduled_date": "2022-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "description": "description",
  "address": "address",
  "comments": "comments",
  "status": 1,
  "user_id": {{userId}}
}

### List by user
GET {{baseUrl}}?user_id={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Find by recovery ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Accept a recovery (recuperador con rol 2; no requiere body)
# Usa una solicitud CREATED/PENDING sin agente y creada por otro usuario.
# Respuesta: 200 con status 2 y agent_id del recuperador autenticado.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Update a recovery
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
{
  "scheduled_date": "2022-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "description": "description",
  "address": "address 2",
  "comments": "comments",
  "status": 1,
  "user_id": 5
}

### Delete a recovery
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Record actual weight and complete the recovery
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "recycled_kg": 12.5,
  "status": 5
}
